{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "\u6676\u77f3\u5b88\u62a4\u8005 (Cubic Defender)",
    "steam_appid": 2713650,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<strong>Game Feature</strong><br><br>\u00b7There is no fixed route tower defense, and the enemy will intelligently find the attacking route. Players need to adjust their formation accordingly;<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2713650/extras/c2c8b65f4455ac07a5565f3d8243adac.avif?t=1721904634\" width=466 height=176 /></span><br><br>\u00b7Diverse maps and strategies require a balance between water, land, and air;<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2713650/extras/cfbdfe5265445ecd52c72e17e9d4281f.avif?t=1721904634\" width=472 height=216 /></span><br><br>\u00b7Several unique heroes can be chosen, each possessing powerful ultimate skills that can turn the tide in desperate situations;<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2713650/extras/66a94691f1ef174635bcdfded79f4d9e.avif?t=1721904634\" width=472 height=150 /></span><br><br>\u00b7Twenty defense towers with different characteristics, including high towers, turrets, roadblocks, and traps, players can freely match to cope with different maps;<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2713650/extras/3b9d77edf8d48d21dbfc428a6fc4dbfd.avif?t=1721904634\" width=472 height=130 /></span><br><br>\u00b7Dozens of chips with different functions can transform your defense tower, giving it additional capabilities and greatly increasing the depth of strategy selection;<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2713650/extras/0573f0612dc9f39e54abf29d212fa185.avif?t=1721904634\" width=472 height=160 /></span><br><br>\u00b7Dozens of different enemies and several powerful bosses await your challenge on the journey;<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2713650/extras/fe8c824d59e1bd860862ac7e3cffe8d2.avif?t=1721904634\" width=472 height=288 /></span><br><br>\u00b7The unique gameplay &quot;Evolution Mode&quot; combines the challenge mode of rougelike elements, and players need to choose an evolution path from scratch during battles.<br><br>\u00b7Gorgeous music and skill effects make the player's combat experience more enjoyable.",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>Game Feature</strong><br><br>\u00b7There is no fixed route tower defense, and the enemy will intelligently find the attacking route. Players need to adjust their formation accordingly;<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2713650/extras/c2c8b65f4455ac07a5565f3d8243adac.avif?t=1721904634\" width=466 height=176 /></span><br><br>\u00b7Diverse maps and strategies require a balance between water, land, and air;<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2713650/extras/cfbdfe5265445ecd52c72e17e9d4281f.avif?t=1721904634\" width=472 height=216 /></span><br><br>\u00b7Several unique heroes can be chosen, each possessing powerful ultimate skills that can turn the tide in desperate situations;<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2713650/extras/66a94691f1ef174635bcdfded79f4d9e.avif?t=1721904634\" width=472 height=150 /></span><br><br>\u00b7Twenty defense towers with different characteristics, including high towers, turrets, roadblocks, and traps, players can freely match to cope with different maps;<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2713650/extras/3b9d77edf8d48d21dbfc428a6fc4dbfd.avif?t=1721904634\" width=472 height=130 /></span><br><br>\u00b7Dozens of chips with different functions can transform your defense tower, giving it additional capabilities and greatly increasing the depth of strategy selection;<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2713650/extras/0573f0612dc9f39e54abf29d212fa185.avif?t=1721904634\" width=472 height=160 /></span><br><br>\u00b7Dozens of different enemies and several powerful bosses await your challenge on the journey;<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2713650/extras/fe8c824d59e1bd860862ac7e3cffe8d2.avif?t=1721904634\" width=472 height=288 /></span><br><br>\u00b7The unique gameplay &quot;Evolution Mode&quot; combines the challenge mode of rougelike elements, and players need to choose an evolution path from scratch during battles.<br><br>\u00b7Gorgeous music and skill effects make the player's combat experience more enjoyable.",
    "short_description": "The core gameplay of Cubic Defender is strategy planning and resource management, with the aim of deploying heroes and defensive towers to eliminate invading enemies.",
